  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Higher Education Scholarships Phase Two (HES-II) is one activity under the umbrella of the Higher Education Advancement and Development (HEAD) project. The purpose of the HEAD project is to improve the effectiveness of educational institutions in order to enhance Lebanons economic stability and prosperity through skill development opportunities and stronger higher education institutions.</narrative>
